Atlas overlay patch 0095: ui/downloads-list
Why: the downloads list of the reel (scene 7, still full-52_6 and pose atlas-downloads-light): a card
headed "Downloads" in small capitals, no close button (Escape and a click outside close it), no footer
row (the full list stays one step away in the menu and with Ctrl J), the document glyph in the accent
colour on every row instead of the icon theme's file-type picture, and the hover and focus fill as a
pill inset in the card like a selected sidebar row, the file name bold, and no quick buttons on hover
(the row menu has the actions; keyboard focus still shows them). CHROME's 0070-0072 give the colours, fonts, radii
and the section-header style; this is the rest of the frame. No setting chooses these, so the smallest
tier is a few hook lines in the two views; the card fill of popovers is one line of the GTK colour
mixer (the menu colour, which the WolOS theme gives as `card`).
Files: chrome/browser/ui/views/download/bubble/download_dialog_view.cc,
 chrome/browser/ui/views/download/bubble/download_bubble_row_view.cc, ui/gtk/gtk_color_mixers.cc
Test filter: reel-check scene R07 (pair with the frame: header, rows, pill, glyph)
Rebase risk: L (a string id, two visibility lines, the row's highlight path, icon colour, label style and hover)
Release: 0.13
License: GPL-3.0-or-later (hunks in files the inherited series patches)
Verified at: 156.0.8078.79, prepared tree with the inherited and platform series applied

